  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling Agriculture Investment in Digital, AI and Innovation (SAIDAI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling Agriculture Investment in Digital, AI &amp; Innovation (SAIDAI) will support &amp; scale the types of digital agriculture innovations that have the most potential for transformative impact, whilst generating evidence of what works, where &amp; for whom. It will:

&#x2022; Catalyse investment at scale in agriculture innovations which expand productivity, uplift incomes &amp; raise climate resilience, including through bringing in institutional investors like BII.
&#x2022; Drive stronger, more sustainable &amp; better integrated agri-food systems in developing countries that deliver safe &amp; nutritious food, including through improved yields, reduced post-harvest loss, &amp; more efficient/resilient supply chains.
&#x2022; Build a stronger enabling environment, including better information on investment opportunities &amp; risks, &amp; greater consensus on how to measure &amp; track impact.
&#x2022; Increase the deployment &amp; adoption of technologies - including digital &amp; AI - that can have the greatest impact on livelihoods &amp; resilience</narrative>
  </description>
